  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PROCIDADES - Colatina</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">PROCIDADES - Colatina</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general del Programa es mejorar la calidad de vida de la poblacin del municipio de Colatina, con base en acciones que incluyen una estrategia de inversiones en infraestructura de saneamiento e inversiones en planes de movilidad urbana, transporte, saneamiento y gestin municipal.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Program&apos;s general objective is to improve the quality of life of the residents of the Municipality of Colatina, based on strategic actions that provide sanitation infrastructure and support the development of urban mobility, transport, traffic and sanitation planning, and municipal management instruments.</narrative>
  </description>
